<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="description" content="面向员工的网络安全警示学习页面：先停一下，再做判断。">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#06142a">
  <title>网络安全警示学习｜先停一下，再做判断</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      color-scheme: dark;
      --background: #06142a;
      --foreground: #eaf6ff;
      --muted: #8eabc8;
      --border: rgba(135, 191, 235, 0.18);
      --navy-950: #030c1b;
      --navy-900: #06142a;
      --electric: #128cff;
      --cyan: #54d7ff;
      --warning: #ff6b3d;
      --ice: #eaf6ff;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    html {
      min-width: 320px;
      background: var(--background);
    }

    body {
      min-width: 320px;
      min-height: 100vh;
      margin: 0;
      background: var(--background);
      color: var(--foreground);
      font-family: "Microsoft YaHei", "PingFang SC", "Noto Sans CJK SC", Arial, sans-serif;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }

    a {
      -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;
    }

    a:focus-visible {
      outline: 2px solid var(--cyan);
      outline-offset: 4px;
    }

    .site-shell {
      min-height: 100vh;
      min-height: 100svh;
      position: relative;
      overflow-x: hidden;
      background:
        linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(84, 215, 255, 0.04) 1px, transparent 1px),
        linear-gradient(rgba(84, 215, 255, 0.04) 1px, transparent 1px),
        radial-gradient(circle at 72% 35%, rgba(18, 140, 255, 0.18), transparent 29rem),
        linear-gradient(145deg, var(--navy-950), var(--navy-900) 48%, #071c38);
      background-size: 56px 56px, 56px 56px, auto, auto;
    }

    .site-shell::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      width: 580px;
      height: 580px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(84, 215, 255, 0.12);
      border-radius: 50%;
      right: -250px;
      top: -250px;
      box-shadow:
        0 0 0 90px rgba(84, 215, 255, 0.02),
        0 0 0 180px rgba(84, 215, 255, 0.02);
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .topbar {
      width: min(1180px, calc(100% - 48px));
      height: 88px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
    }

    .brand {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      color: inherit;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .brand-mark {
      width: 42px;
      height: 42px;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      background: var(--electric);
      color: #fff;
      clip-path: polygon(50% 0, 92% 18%, 86% 74%, 50% 100%, 14% 74%, 8% 18%);
    }

    .brand-mark svg {
      width: 20px;
      height: 20px;
      fill: none;
      stroke: currentColor;
      stroke-width: 2.3;
      stroke-linecap: round;
      stroke-linejoin: round;
    }

    .brand b,
    .brand small {
      display: block;
    }

    .brand b {
      font-size: 15px;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    }

    .brand small {
      margin-top: 3px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-family: Consolas, "SFMono-Regular", monospace;
      font-size: 9px;
      letter-spacing: 0.17em;
    }

    .learning-status {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 14px;
      color: #9fb9d2;
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .learning-status strong {
      color: var(--cyan);
      font-family: Consolas, "SFMono-Regular", monospace;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .progress-line {
      width: 82px;
      height: 3px;
      background: #1a3d62;
    }

    .progress-line i {
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      background: var(--cyan);
      box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(84, 215, 255, 0.55);
    }

    .hero {
      width: min(1180px, calc(100% - 48px));
      min-height: calc(100vh - 88px);
      min-height: calc(100svh - 88px);
      margin: 0 auto;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 880px);
      align-items: center;
      padding: 54px 0 74px;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      color: var(--cyan);
      font-family: Consolas, "SFMono-Regular", monospace;
      font-size: 12px;
      letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    }

    .live-dot {
      width: 8px;
      height: 8px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--warning);
      box-shadow:
        0 0 0 5px rgba(255, 107, 61, 0.12),
        0 0 18px rgba(255, 107, 61, 0.7);
    }

    h1 {
      margin: 28px 0 24px;
      font-family: "Microsoft JhengHei", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif;
      font-size: clamp(48px, 5.6vw, 76px);
      font-weight: 800;
      line-height: 1.12;
      letter-spacing: -0.055em;
    }

    h1 span {
      display: block;
      color: transparent;
      -webkit-text-stroke: 1px #8bdfff;
      text-shadow: 0 0 32px rgba(18, 140, 255, 0.18);
    }

    .hero-lead {
      max-width: 570px;
      margin: 0;
      color: #a9bfd4;
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 1.95;
    }

    .hero-lead strong {
      color: var(--ice);
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .pulse-track {
      max-width: 620px;
      margin-top: 54px;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(84, 215, 255, 0.11);
      position: relative;
    }

    .pulse-track > span {
      position: absolute;
      top: -19px;
      left: 0;
      color: #4e708f;
      font-family: Consolas, monospace;
      font-size: 8px;
      letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    }

    .pulse-track svg {
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
      height: 54px;
      overflow: visible;
    }

    .pulse-track path {
      fill: none;
      stroke-linecap: square;
      stroke-linejoin: bevel;
    }

    .pulse-base {
      stroke: #1b466b;
      stroke-width: 1;
    }

    .pulse-hot {
      stroke: var(--cyan);
      stroke-width: 2;
      filter: drop-shadow(0 0 5px rgba(84, 215, 255, 0.55));
      stroke-dasharray: 230;
      animation: pulseDraw 2.4s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
    }

    @keyframes pulseDraw {
      from {
        stroke-dashoffset: 230;
        opacity: 0.45;
      }
      to {
        stroke-dashoffset: 0;
        opacity: 1;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .hero {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        padding: 58px 0 72px;
      }

      .hero-copy {
        max-width: 690px;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      .topbar,
      .hero {
        width: min(100% - 30px, 1180px);
      }

      .topbar {
        height: 72px;
      }

      .learning-status > span,
      .progress-line {
        display: none;
      }

      .hero {
        min-height: calc(100vh - 72px);
        min-height: calc(100svh - 72px);
        padding: 46px 0 62px;
      }

      h1 {
        margin-top: 22px;
        font-size: clamp(39px, 12vw, 54px);
        letter-spacing: -0.07em;
      }

      .hero-lead {
        font-size: 14px;
      }

      .pulse-track {
        margin-top: 44px;
      }
    }

    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      .pulse-hot {
        animation: none;
        stroke-dashoffset: 0;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main class="site-shell" id="top">
    <header class="topbar">
      <a class="brand" href="#top" aria-label="网络安全警示学习首页">
        <span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"></path>
            <path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path>
          </svg>
        </span>
        <span>
          <b>安全意识学习站</b>
          <small>SECURITY AWARENESS</small>
        </span>
      </a>

      <div class="learning-status" aria-label="单页警示学习">
        <span>警示学习</span>
        <div class="progress-line" aria-hidden="true"><i></i></div>
        <strong>01 / 01</strong>
      </div>
    </header>

    <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="page-title">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <div class="eyebrow">
          <span class="live-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          员工网络安全警示学习
        </div>

        <h1 id="page-title">
          一次犹豫，
          <span>可能就是攻击者的入口。</span>
        </h1>

        <p class="hero-lead">
          攻击者不需要攻破所有系统，只需要等一个人点开链接、交出验证码，或忽略一次异常。
          <strong>先停一下，再做判断。</strong>
        </p>

        <div class="pulse-track" aria-label="安全警戒线">
          <span>SECURITY PULSE</span>
          <svg viewBox="0 0 620 54" role="img" aria-label="持续监测的安全脉冲波形">
            <path class="pulse-base" d="M0 31h178l12-8 12 8h46l12-22 19 40 18-18h58l10-8 12 8h243"></path>
            <path class="pulse-hot" d="M178 31l12-8 12 8h46l12-22 19 40 18-18h58"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
